      "sha": "b3d2bacd69a63ecba3333e46242500b36ffb58b9",
      "message": "ci: unify nightly toolchain pin behind rust-toolchain and add drift guard\n\nThe nightly version string nightly-2026-04-16 was hardcoded in four\nplaces with no automated enforcement, causing a high-friction failure\nmode when pins drifted apart.\n\n- Declare rust-toolchain as the single source of truth for the\n  nightly channel version.\n- Add validate-toolchain-pins.sh — a drift-guard script that checks\n  every file's pin matches the canonical version and validates the\n  clippy_utils git rev date against the nightly date.\n- Wire the script into CI as a new validate-toolchain-pins job.\n- Document the upgrade procedure in CONTRIBUTING.md with step-by-step\n  instructions and which file to edit first.",
      "isVerified": false,
      "authoredAt": "2026-07-23T22:14:45Z"
    },
